      "instance_name": "angry_confrontation",
      "label": "angry_confrontation",
      "description": "A scene depicting Gordon Ramsay in an angry expression, confronting another person who is facing away from the camera. The scene is framed to emphasize Ramsay's intense facial expression and his direct engagement with the other person, who is partially visible and wearing a cap. The text overlay adds a humorous but racially charged context to the interaction.",
